Customer->>UI: "Recommend a gaming laptop"

UI->>Agent: Conversation Request

Agent->>Planner: Build Plan

Planner->>Planner: Determine required tools

Planner->>ToolRuntime: search_products()

ToolRuntime->>GoAPI: Internal Tool API

GoAPI->>RetailConnector: Search Products

RetailConnector->>RetailAPI: Query

RetailAPI-->>RetailConnector: Products

RetailConnector-->>GoAPI: Normalized Catalog

GoAPI-->>ToolRuntime: Structured Result

ToolRuntime-->>Agent: Observation

Agent->>Planner: Continue Planning

Planner->>ToolRuntime: retrieve_promotions()

ToolRuntime->>GoAPI: Promotion Tool

GoAPI->>RetailConnector: Promotion API

RetailConnector-->>GoAPI: Promotions

GoAPI-->>ToolRuntime: Promotion Data

ToolRuntime-->>Agent: Observation

Agent->>Memory: Read Customer Preference

Memory-->>Agent: Preferences

Agent->>Agent: Final Reasoning

Agent-->>UI: Recommendation + Dynamic UI